Subject: Shelter tonight
To: N0IGOV
Type: Private

Long day. The shelter count went from 31 to 52 after the evacuation order expanded. Kitchen crew is stretched thin and asked for two more volunteers for the dinner shift. Medical had three minor cases, all treated on site. Pets are in the side building and that is working well. Tomorrow we expect the count to drop once the road reopens, but nobody has confirmed a time yet. I will send the formal report on the form at 1800.
